    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, the Run phase will focus on ensuring the long-term sustainability and maintenance of the solution. our company's past experience in delivering AI assistance solutions to public sector clients, such as the regional hospital group, has equipped our company's with the expertise to handle complex healthcare projects. our company's will leverage our company's flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents. leverage will enable our company's to provide a tailored solution that meets the client's specific needs and integrates seamlessly with the client's existing systems. our company's consortium partners, including OuraneCloud and Ligeo Santé, will play a crucial role in ensuring the success of The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "OuraneCloud will provide the hosting infrastructure, while Ligeo Santé, will assist with SIH/DPI integration and FHIR/INS interoperability work." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of available capacity, our company's have a dedicated team consisting of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead. a dedicated team consisting of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead will be responsible for delivering The project, and our company's have confirmed a dedicated team consisting of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead availability for this engagement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure that our company's meet The client budget constraints, our company's will work closely with The client to prioritize the requirements and scope of The project. our company's governance practices, including a joint steering committee and operational committee, will provide a framework for regular progress updates and decision-making. our company's will also maintain a RACI matrix to ensure clear roles and responsibilities throughout The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's expertise and experience in delivering similar projects, our company's are confident that our company's can deliver The project within the allocated budget of 900,000 EUR over 5 years while ensuring that the annual operating cost remains controlled. our company's focus on agile delivery, combined with our company's robust governance practices, will enable our company's to respond quickly to changing requirements and ensure the successful delivery of The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), provide API-type interfaces, and support health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also ensure a high level of answer relevance, achieve a response time below 2 seconds, and guarantee an availability target of 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Can our current technical stack meet these requirements, and what architecture do our propose? our platform, Atelier, is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can be integrated with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI) through standard connectors and custom adapters for SIH/DPI integration. our also support API-first design with documented APIs, which can provide the necessary API-type interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of health interoperability standards, our architecture and integration capabilities include a FHIR/HL7 connector, which supports production for main resources and has extended resource coverage on the roadmap. a FHIR/HL7 connector, which supports production for main resources and has extended resource coverage on the roadmap should meet the requirements for supporting HL7 and FHIR standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding performance, Our company's platform, Atelier median latency is 1.3 seconds, and the p95 latency is below 2.5 seconds, which should meet the response time requirement of below 2 seconds for common queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Our company's platform, Atelier scales horizontally with additional inference capacity to handle increased throughput." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For availability, our have a built-in redundancy mechanism with active-active deployment across two availability zones, which can help achieve an availability target of 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
